<li>&lt;a href="Seungumcho%20dasik"&gt;Seungumcho dasik&lt;/a&gt; yaiku dasik ijo kang digawé saka campuran bahan bubuk tuwuhan seungumcho (&lt;a href="Angelica%20gigas"&gt;Angelica gigas&lt;/a&gt;).</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Dasik%20putih"&gt;Dasik putih&lt;/a&gt; yaiku dasik kang digawé saka &lt;a href="pati%20%28polisakarida%29"&gt;pati&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kacang"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
