Vicky Nitinegoro (#ALIH). Vicky Nitinegoro misuwur dadi &lt;a href="modh%C3%A9l"&gt;modhél&lt;/a&gt; lan juru main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Karir Vicky Nitinegoro kawiwitan saka bintang &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé iku Vicky Nitinegoro banjur njajal &lt;a href="akting"&gt;akting&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt;. Sinetron sepisanan kang dibintangi Vicky ya iku Kisah Sedih di Hari Minggu. Ing sinétron iki Vicky akting karo aktris kang jenengé &lt;a href="Marshanda"&gt;Marshanda&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging Vicky mung main nganti 10 wpisode ing sinétron iki. Sinetron liyané kang nggawé jenengé misuwur ya iku &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé Putri Cahaya. Ing sinétron iki Vicky akting karo &lt;a href="Intan%20Nuraini"&gt;Intan Nuraini&lt;/a&gt;. Malah nalika iku leloroné nganti kena cinta lokasi. Sinetron liyané kang dibintangi Vicky Nitinegoro ya iku sinétron kang judhulé Cowok Impian, Ande-ande Lumut, sarta Kau dan Aku.
Vicky iku anak wuragil saka sadulur kang cacahé loro.
Sawisé iku Vicky uga njajal akting layar lebar. Vicky banjur main ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; The Shaman nalika taun (2007). Ing filem iki Vicky main karo &lt;a href="Bintang%20Oka%20Antara"&gt;Bintang Oka Antara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kemal%20Vivien"&gt;Kemal Vivien&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Farrah%20Debby"&gt;Farrah Debby&lt;/a&gt;, ugaa &lt;a href="Julia%20Perez"&gt;Julia Perez&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dirly%20Sompie"&gt;Dirly Sompie&lt;/a&gt; dadi &lt;a href="cameo"&gt;cameo&lt;/a&gt;.
Ora mung akting, Vicky uga njajal nyanyi. Bareng karo &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt; liyané kang cacahé sanga ya iku &lt;a href="Nicky%20Tirta"&gt;Nicky Tirta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ian%20Arya"&gt;Ian Arya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Roger%20Danuarta"&gt;Roger Danuarta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dimas%20Seto"&gt;Dimas Seto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dwi%20Andhika"&gt;Dwi Andhika&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kiki%20Rizky"&gt;Kiki Rizky&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rifky%20Abdullah"&gt;Rifky Abdullah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gugun%20Gondrong"&gt;Gugun Gondrong&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Atoy%20Herlambang"&gt;Atoy Herlambang&lt;/a&gt;. Vicky nggawe &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kompilasi kang sepisanan nalika tanggal &lt;a href="14"&gt;14&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. Album kanthi tema "10 Male Sinetron Artist: Compilation Album" iki di-packing karo &lt;a href="Chique%20Mayoise%20Anggitha"&gt;Chique Mayoise Anggitha&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="CQ%20Music%20Indonesia"&gt;CQ Music Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;.
