Uli Auliani

Uli Auliani (#ALIH). Uli Auliani iku salah sijiné juru main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; wadon kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Uli Auliani dikenal lumantar perané ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maskot%20%28filem%29"&gt;Maskot&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku Uli Auliani uga misuwur ing filem kang judhulé &lt;a href="Pulau%20Hantu%202"&gt;Pulau Hantu 2&lt;/a&gt;. Uli Auliani uga dikenal dadi presenter infotainment &lt;a href="Kroscek"&gt;Kroscek&lt;/a&gt; kang disiyaraké ing salah sijiné stasiun &lt;a href="tivi"&gt;tivi&lt;/a&gt; swasta kang jenenge &lt;a href="Trans%20TV"&gt;Trans TV&lt;/a&gt;. Sadurungé iku, Uli Auliani uga tau dadi bintang filem kang disutradarai karo &lt;a href="sutradara"&gt;sutradara&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hanny%20Saputra"&gt;Hanny Saputra&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki judhule &lt;a href="Virgin"&gt;Virgin&lt;/a&gt;. Film Virgin digawé nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; (2004). Saliyané filem Virgin, Uli Auliani uga main ing filem kang genrené horor kang digarap karo sutradara &lt;a href="Hanung%20Bramantyo"&gt;Hanung Bramantyo&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki judhulé &lt;a href="Legenda%20Sundel%20Bolong"&gt;Legenda Sundel Bolong&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki digawé nalika taun (2007). Uli Auliani iku artis kang tau pacaran karo &lt;a href="Robert%20Sean%20King"&gt;Robert Sean King&lt;/a&gt;. Robert Sean King uga tau cerak karo artis kang jenengé &lt;a href="Rahma%20Azhari"&gt;Rahma Azhari&lt;/a&gt;, Uli Auliani uga tau main ing filem ing layar lebar. Nalika taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, Uli Auliani uga tau main ing filem kang cacahé papat. Film-filem iki judhulé ya iku &lt;a href="Pulau%20Hantu%202"&gt;Pulau Hantu 2&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="Asoy%20Geboy"&gt;Asoy Geboy&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="Anak%20Ajaib"&gt;Anak Ajaib&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Setan%20Budeg"&gt;Setan Budeg&lt;/a&gt;. Film kang paling anyar kang dibintangi Uli Auliani ya iku filem kang judhulé &lt;a href="Pocong%20Setan%20Jompo"&gt;Pocong Setan Jompo&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki digawé nalika wiwitané &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;.
Uli Auliani tau fose syur ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhule pulau hantu 2. Iki ancasé kanggo ndongkrak kariré.
