Muhammad Dwi Andhika akrab diundang kanthi jeneng Dwi Andhika (#ALIH). Dwi Andhika iku salah sijiné juru main &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; lan juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Dwi Andhika miwiti karir dadi bintang &lt;a href="modh%C3%A9l"&gt;modhél&lt;/a&gt;. Dwi Andhika tau dadi juwara favorit Cover Boy nalika taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;. Dwi Andhika iku anak saka (alm) &lt;a href="Drs.%20Ruchiat%20DGA"&gt;Drs. Ruchiat DGA&lt;/a&gt;. Dwi Andhika banjur njajal karir ing donyaning presenter kanthi mimpin acara kang jenengé "Planet Remaja". Ora mung dadi cover boy lan &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt;, Andhika uga wiwit njajal akting ing akting. Sinetron kang tau dibintangi Dwi Adhika kaya ta sinétron kang judhulé "&lt;a href="Joey%20%26amp%3B%20Jessy"&gt;Joey &amp; Jessy&lt;/a&gt;", "&lt;a href="Single%20Parent"&gt;Single Parent&lt;/a&gt;", "&lt;a href="Dina%20dan%20Lisa"&gt;Dina dan Lisa&lt;/a&gt;", "&lt;a href="Doa%20dan%20Anugerah"&gt;Doa dan Anugerah&lt;/a&gt;", "&lt;a href="Jin%20Kocak"&gt;Jin Kocak&lt;/a&gt;", lan "&lt;a href="Pemburu%20Hantu"&gt;Pemburu Hantu&lt;/a&gt;". Saliyané iku uga sinétron kang duwé judhul "&lt;a href="Ada%20Apa%20Dengan%20Cinta"&gt;Ada Apa Dengan Cinta&lt;/a&gt;" versi sinétron. Andhika uga tau main ing layar lebar kaya ta dadi pemin pendhukung ing filem kang judhulé "&lt;a href="Hantu"&gt;Hantu&lt;/a&gt;", lan bersama &lt;a href="Ayushita"&gt;Ayushita&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ardina%20Rasti"&gt;Ardina Rasti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hengky%20Kurniawan"&gt;Hengky Kurniawan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Raffi%20Ahmad"&gt;Raffi Ahmad&lt;/a&gt; main ing filem kang judhulé "&lt;a href="Me%20vs%20High%20Heels"&gt;Me vs High Heels&lt;/a&gt;".
Nalika taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, Dwi Andhika duwé rencana kanggo nggawé album rekaman kang sepisanan. Andhika wani nggawé album sawisé menang dadi juwara 2 ing program acara variety show "Seleb Mendadak Dangdut". Sanajan album perdanane iku &lt;a href="musik%20pop"&gt;musik pop&lt;/a&gt; dudu &lt;a href="dangdut"&gt;dangdut&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
