<doc id="77573" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=77573" title="Ulfa Dwiyanti">
Ulfa Dwiyanti

Ulfa Dwiyanti (#ALIH). Ulfa Dwiyanti iku presenter lan pelawak ing donyaning hiburan &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé miwiti karire dadi penyiar &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt;, wong wadon kang nduwé dedeg 152 cm iki misuwur dadi kanca rakete &lt;a href="Eko%20Patrio"&gt;Eko Patrio&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Taufik%20Savalas"&gt;Taufik Savalas&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
Kauripan pribadi.
Ulfa Dwiyanti wis pegatan karo bojoné kang nomer telu kang jenengé &lt;a href="Muhammad%20Abdul%20Hakim"&gt;Muhammad Abdul Hakim&lt;/a&gt;, SH, wong lanang kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Kutha%20Padang"&gt;Padang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sumatera%20Barat"&gt;Sumatera Barat&lt;/a&gt; nalika tanggal &lt;a href="4"&gt;4&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; 2006. Ulfa Dwiyanti dinikahi karo Abdul Hakim nalika tanggal &lt;a href="19%20September"&gt;19 September&lt;/a&gt; 2003 kapungkur ing &lt;a href="Pondok%20Pesantren%20Suryalaya"&gt;Pondok Pesantren Suryalaya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pagerageung%2C%20Tasikmalaya"&gt;Pagerageung, Tasikmalaya&lt;/a&gt;. Pernikahan iki ing ngarepé guru besar &lt;a href="Abah%20Anom"&gt;Abah Anom&lt;/a&gt; lan kulawarga saka pengantin leloroné. Nanging leloroné banjur pegatan. Sadurungé Ulfa Dwiyanti wis tau nikah karo &lt;a href="Dhanny%20Indrianto"&gt;Dhanny Indrianto&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging pernikahané karo wong lanang kang duwé profesi dadi &lt;a href="wartawan"&gt;wartawan&lt;/a&gt; iku uga cerai. Nalika tanggal &lt;a href="6%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;6 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; 2000, Ulfa Dwiyanti nikah manèh karo wong lanang kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt; kang jenengé &lt;a href="Klaas%20Poll%20Jr."&gt;Klaas Poll Jr.&lt;/a&gt;, kang ganti jeneng dadi &lt;a href="Muhammad%20Ikhlas%20Poll%20Jr"&gt;Muhammad Ikhlas Poll Jr&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging leloroné uga cerai nalika sasi &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; 2001 ing &lt;a href="Pengadilan%20Agama"&gt;Pengadilan Agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jakarta%20Selatan"&gt;Jakarta Selatan&lt;/a&gt;.
