Festival Ginseng Geumsan.
&lt;a href="Festival%20Ginseng%20Geumsan"&gt;Festival Ginseng Geumsan&lt;/a&gt; ya iku festival kang dianakake saben setaun kanggo mromosekake kutha Geumsan lan produk ginsenge. Festival iki dianakake sepuluh dina sawisé dina raya &lt;a href="Chuseok"&gt;Chuseok&lt;/a&gt;.
