<doc id="77731" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=77731" title="Hanna-Barbera Productions">
Hanna-Barbera Productions

Hanna-Barbera Productions, Inc. (utawa Hanna-Barbera Cartoons, Inc., H-B Enterprises, Inc., utawa biyasa dikenal Hanna-Barbera) ya iku studio animasi &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang aktif saka taun &lt;a href="1944"&gt;1944&lt;/a&gt; nganti taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iki diadhegké taun 1944 déning &lt;a href="MGM"&gt;MGM&lt;/a&gt;, kang dijurung &lt;a href="William%20Hanna"&gt;William Hanna&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Joseph%20Barbera"&gt;Joseph Barbera&lt;/a&gt; lan dijenengi Hanna-Barbera Enterprises. Saiki, jeneng "Hanna-Barbera" mung dienggo dadi unit saka &lt;a href="Warner%20Bros."&gt;Warner Bros. Animation&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Perusahaan iki didegké déning &lt;a href="MGM"&gt;MGM&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1944. Sawisé MGM nutup studio animasi taun 1957, Hanna lan Barbera wiwit kerja dhéwé ing H-B Enterprises. Dudutan iku digawé kanggo berspesialisasi ing tivi animasi. Supaya éntuk modal kanggo kerja kanggo ngasilké kartun, Hanna-Barbera telah kerjabebarengan karo &lt;a href="Screen%20Gems"&gt;Screen Gems&lt;/a&gt;, unit saka &lt;a href="Columbia%20Pictures"&gt;Columbia Pictures&lt;/a&gt;. Serial TV H-B kang pisanan ya iku &lt;a href="The%20Ruff%20%26amp%3B%20Reddy%20Show"&gt;The Ruff &amp; Reddy Show&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika taun 1958, H-B suksès banget ing sérial &lt;a href="The%20Huckleberry%20Hound%20Show"&gt;The Huckleberry Hound Show&lt;/a&gt;, sing mèlu ing sèrial iku ya iku &lt;a href="Huckleberry%20Hound"&gt;Huckleberry Hound&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Yogi%20Bear"&gt;Yogi Bear&lt;/a&gt;. Sèrial iki tau éntuk bebungah saka &lt;a href="Emmy%20Awards"&gt;Emmy Awards&lt;/a&gt;.
Perusahaan iki uga tau produksi sérial cekak &lt;a href="Hey%20There%2C%20It%27s%20Yogi%20Bear%21"&gt;Hey There, It's Yogi Bear!&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="The%20Man%20Called%20Flintstone"&gt;The Man Called Flintstone&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun &lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt;, perusahaan iki dituku déning &lt;a href="Taft%20Broadcasting"&gt;Taft Broadcasting&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iki mproduksi sérial TV &lt;a href="Scooby-Doo%2C%20Where%20Are%20You%21"&gt;Scooby-Doo, Where Are You!&lt;/a&gt;. Banjur nyusul &lt;a href="Josie%20and%20the%20Pussycats"&gt;Josie and the Pussycats&lt;/a&gt; (1970-72), &lt;a href="The%20Funky%20Phantom"&gt;The Funky Phantom&lt;/a&gt; (1971-72), &lt;a href="Speed%20Buggy"&gt;Speed Buggy&lt;/a&gt; (1973-74), &lt;a href="Clue%20Club"&gt;Clue Club&lt;/a&gt; (1976-78).
