Mercedes Grand Prix

Mercedes Grand Prix ya iku salah sujiné tim balap &lt;a href="Formula%20Satu"&gt;Formula Satu&lt;/a&gt;. Tim iki nduwé pabrikan mobil &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Mercedes-Benz"&gt;Mercedes-Benz&lt;/a&gt;. Mercedes Grand Prik wiwit mèlu ing ajang F1 nalika mangsa 1954, banjur bisa sukses nalika mangsa &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt;. Ing akir mangsa 1955, Mercedes Grand Prix mundur banjur dadi pemasok &lt;a href="mesin"&gt;mesin&lt;/a&gt; manèh nalika pertengahan &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;-an. Mercy banjur mbalik ing &lt;a href="F1"&gt;F1&lt;/a&gt; dadi tim penuh nalika mangsa, dené kang dadi induké ya iku &lt;a href="Daimler%20AG"&gt;Daimler AG&lt;/a&gt; kang nduwéni kerjasama karo Aaba Investments kang mutusaké tuku 75,1% (Daimler: 45.1%; Aabar: 30%) saham tim &lt;a href="Brawn%20GP"&gt;Brawn GP&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé iku banjur ngowahi jeneng dadi Mercedes-Benz Grand Prix. Ing taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, Daimler banjur ngundhakaké cacahé saham ing tim &lt;a href="Mercedes%20GP"&gt;Mercedes GP&lt;/a&gt; dadi 100% kanthi tuku sisa 24,9% saham kang idih dicekel karo &lt;a href="Ross%20Brawn"&gt;Ross Brawn&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Nick%20Fry"&gt;Nick Fry&lt;/a&gt;, saéngga tim iki dadi tim &lt;a href="Mercedes-Benz"&gt;Mercedes-Benz&lt;/a&gt; kang penuh ing ajang F1.
<h2>Sajarah tim</h2>
Sajarah tim.
Mercedes-Benz wis mèlu ing &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20Motor%20Racing"&gt;Grand Prix Motor Racing&lt;/a&gt; (cikal bakal &lt;a href="Formula%201"&gt;Formula 1&lt;/a&gt;) wiwit taun &lt;a href="1923"&gt;1923&lt;/a&gt;, nalika Tropfenwagen Benz dikenalké kanggo balapan &lt;a href="Grand%20Prix%20%C3%89ropah"&gt;GP Éropah&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Autodromo%20Monza"&gt;Monza&lt;/a&gt;. Panemu iki diéntuki saka salah sijiné insinyur Benz &lt;a href="Hans%20Nibel"&gt;Hans Nibel&lt;/a&gt;, kang nduwéni inspirasi saka &lt;a href="Tropfenwagen%20Rumpler"&gt;Tropfenwagen Rumpler&lt;/a&gt; lan ancasé kanggo ngundhakaké daya tarik marketing kanggo adol mobil kang nduwéni mesin tengah kanthi tampilan kang mirib &lt;a href="Auto%20Union"&gt;Auto Union&lt;/a&gt; lan nggunakaké sasis tiruan Rumpler kang dibangun sadurungé kanggo &lt;a href="Auto%20Union"&gt;Auto Union&lt;/a&gt;. Mesin mobil balap iki nduwéni tenaga 80&amp;nbsp;hp kanthi kapasitas 1991cc lan didhaku bisa lumayu kanthi kacepatan sandhuwuré 140&amp;nbsp;km/jam.
