<doc id="77802" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=77802" title="Columbia Pictures">
Columbia Pictures

Columbia Pictures Industries, Inc. yaiku perusahaan saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang mrodhuksi &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; lan acara tivi. yaiku pérangan Columbia TriStar Motion Picture Group, kang diduwèni &lt;a href="Sony%20Pictures%20Entertainment"&gt;Sony Pictures Entertainment&lt;/a&gt;. Sony Pictures yaiku pérangan perusahaan &lt;a href="Sony"&gt;Sony&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Sadurungé perusahaan iki dimulai, &lt;a href="Cohn-Brandt-Cohn%20Film%20Sales"&gt;Cohn-Brandt-Cohn Film Sales&lt;/a&gt; yaiku studio filem kang dikembangaké déning &lt;a href="Harry%20Cohn"&gt;Harry Cohn&lt;/a&gt;. CBC Film Sales diadegé nalika taun &lt;a href="1919"&gt;1919&lt;/a&gt; déning Harry Cohn, &lt;a href="Jack%20Cohn"&gt;Jack Cohn&lt;/a&gt; lan Joe Brandt. Bradnt iku présidèn pisanan CBC Film Sales kang tugasé pérangan pangadolan lan distribusi saka Hollywood, dibantu Harry Cohn lan Jack Cohn. Akèh studio-mènèhi anggaran dhuwur.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="1924"&gt;1924&lt;/a&gt;, Harry Cohn njabat dadi présidèn. Wiwit iku organisasi mau dijenengaké "Columbia Pictures Industries, Inc.". Organisasi iki tugasé mproduksi filem-filem saka Hollywood. Salah siji tugasé yaiku bekerja bareng &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Productions&lt;/a&gt;. Lan uga ngedol filem kang wis digawé.
Ing Pungkasan era &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt;-an, Columbia Pictures ngedegaké &lt;a href="Screen%20Gems"&gt;Screen Gems&lt;/a&gt; dadi studio animasi filem kartun unggulan, &lt;a href="Krazy%20Kat"&gt;Krazy Kat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Scrappy"&gt;Scrappy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Fox%20and%20the%20Crow"&gt;The Fox and the Crow&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Li%27l%20Abner"&gt;Li'l Abner&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika perusahaan iki mandeggé panganggoan merk Screen Gems, perusahaan iki uga mproduksi acara kartun. Ing taun 1948, perusahaan iki ngukuhaké jeneng Screen Gems kanggo jaringan produksi tivi. Ing era &lt;a href="1950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt;-an, perusahaan iki mandegge serial mini. Perusahaan iki tambah maju ing saben taun.
