Posisiné sangsaya ndadi nalika dhèwèké dhaup karo manajer rekaman &lt;a href="Ren%C3%A9%20Angelil"&gt;René Angelil&lt;/a&gt;.
Awit saka campur tangan bojoné iku, Céline bisa menangaké Yamaha World Popular Song Festival (&lt;a href="1982"&gt;1982&lt;/a&gt;) lan the 1988 Eurovision Song Contest ngwakili Switserlan mawa laguné &lt;a href="Ne%20partez%20pas%20sans%20moi"&gt;Ne partez pas sans moi&lt;/a&gt;.
