<doc id="77893" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=77893" title="Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer">
Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer

Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Inc., utawa MGM yaiku &lt;a href="parusahan"&gt;parusahan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="multinasional"&gt;multinasional&lt;/a&gt; kang ngasilaké warna-warna prodhuk &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;. Kantoré ana ing &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles%2C%20California"&gt;Los Angeles, California&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Diadegaké ing tanggal &lt;a href="16%20April"&gt;16 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1924"&gt;1924&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iki duwé 1.440 karyawan nganti taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
&lt;a href="Marcus%20Loew"&gt;Marcus Loew&lt;/a&gt; tuku perusahaan &lt;a href="Metro%20Pictures%20Corporation"&gt;Metro Pictures Corporation&lt;/a&gt; diadegaké taun 1916 lan &lt;a href="Goldwyn%20Pictures"&gt;Goldwyn Pictures&lt;/a&gt; diadegaké taun 1917 kanggo ngasilaké filem kanggo rantai teater kang gedhé, &lt;a href="Loew%27s%20Theatres"&gt;Loew's Theatres&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging, tukonan iku nyiptakké kabutuhan wong kanggo ngawasi operasi gedhé-gedhénan ing &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt;, wiwit suwé asisten &lt;a href="Nicholas%20Schenck"&gt;Nicholas Schenck&lt;/a&gt; dibutuhké ing kutha &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; kanggo ngawasi &lt;a href="biyoskup"&gt;biyoskup&lt;/a&gt;. Loew mbahas situasi kanggo tuku studio &lt;a href="Mayer%20Pictures"&gt;Mayer Pictures&lt;/a&gt; ing tanggal &lt;a href="16%20April"&gt;16 April&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1924"&gt;1924&lt;/a&gt;.
Lumrahé, dipresentasiké: "&lt;a href="Louis%20B.%20Mayer"&gt;Louis B. Mayer&lt;/a&gt; presents a Metro-Goldwyn picture". Nanging Mayer nambahké jenenge ing jeneng studio iku, dadi ndadékaké studio iku lanmaskotnya, yaiku Leo the Lion, lan sesanti "Ars Gratia Artis" dadi merk MGM.
Wiwit pisanan, MGM ngarah ning penonton kabutuhan kanggo kemewahan lan kecanggihan. Sawisé mariské jeneng-jeneng gedhé saka perusahaan sadurungé, Mayer lan Thalberg wiwit nggawé lan nyeponsoraké bintang anyar, yaiku &lt;a href="Greta%20Garbo"&gt;Greta Garbo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="John%20Gilbert"&gt;John Gilbert&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="William%20Haines"&gt;William Haines&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Norma%20Shearer"&gt;Norma Shearer&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Joan%20Crawford"&gt;Joan Crawford&lt;/a&gt;. Wong liya kang dikerjakaké yaiku &lt;a href="Lon%20Chaney"&gt;Lon Chaney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="William%20Powell"&gt;William Powell&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Buster%20Keaton"&gt;Buster Keaton&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Wallace%20Beery"&gt;Wallace Beery&lt;/a&gt;.
