Cartoon Network

CN Cartoon NTWK ya iku jaringan tivi kabel kang diadegaké &lt;a href="Turner%20Broadcasting"&gt;Turner Broadcasting&lt;/a&gt; kang nomer siji dadi acara unggulan ya iku &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;-filem animasi. Saluran iki pisanan wiwit giyaran ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; tanggal &lt;a href="1%20Oktober"&gt;1 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Ing akir taun 1980-an, konglomerat TV kabel &lt;a href="Ted%20Turner"&gt;Ted Turner&lt;/a&gt; njupuk genti koleksi filem &lt;a href="MGM%20Grand%20Las%20Vegas"&gt;MGM&lt;/a&gt; (kalebu filem kartun kang ana warnané Warner Bros. pra-1948), lan nayangké koleksi filem animasi iku mau ning TV kabel &lt;a href="Turner%20Network%20Television"&gt;Turner Network Television&lt;/a&gt; kang diduwèni. Giyaran iku akèh disenengi penonton, lan ditutukké Ted Turner nganti tuku studio animasi &lt;a href="Hanna-Barbera%20Productions"&gt;Hanna-Barbera Productions&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt;. Kanti akuisisi iki berarti koleksi filem Hanna Barbera lan koleksi filem produksi &lt;a href="Ruby-Spears%20Productions"&gt;Ruby-Spears Productions&lt;/a&gt; dadi nggonané Ted Turner. Koleksi filem animasi Ted Turner kang dadi tambah akèh saingga Cartoon Network diadegké kanggo nayangkané. Giyaran-tayangan pisanan saluran iki ya iku pamutaran filem-filem kartun klasik produksi &lt;a href="Warner%20Bros."&gt;Warner Bros.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="MGM"&gt;MGM&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Hanna-Barbera"&gt;Hanna-Barbera&lt;/a&gt;, kaya &lt;a href="The%20Jetsons"&gt;The Jetsons&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="The%20Flinstones"&gt;The Flinstones&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="Willy%20Ovesen"&gt;Wally Gator&lt;/a&gt; kang dienggo dadi tayangan selingan. Kakéan filem animasi kang ditayangké ing paket tayangan kang suwéné setengah jam utawa sakjam, kaya ta Down With Droopy D kang nampilké &lt;a href="Droopy%20Dog"&gt;Droopy Dog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tom%20and%20Jerry"&gt;Tom and Jerry&lt;/a&gt; Show kang isiné kucing lan tikus kang lagi gudag-gudagan, lan paket Bugs and Daffy Tonight kang nampilké karakter&lt;a href="Looney%20Tunes"&gt;Looney Tunes&lt;/a&gt;. Saiki mung kari &lt;a href="Tom%20and%20Jerry"&gt;Tom and Jerry&lt;/a&gt; kang isih diputer.
