<doc id="77922" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=77922" title="Citibank">
Citibank

Citibank ya iku bank AS pisanan kang ngenalake &lt;a href="ATM"&gt;ATM&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1970-an"&gt;1970-an&lt;/a&gt;. Citibank diadegaké taun &lt;a href="http%3A//jv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php%3Ftitle%3DCitibank%26amp%3Baction%3Dedit%26amp%3B%2391%3B1812%26amp%3B%2393%3B"&gt;&lt;/a&gt; dadi Bank Kutha &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1894"&gt;1894&lt;/a&gt; bank iki dadi &lt;a href="bank"&gt;bank&lt;/a&gt; gedhé dhéwé ana ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1902"&gt;1902&lt;/a&gt; citybank nganakake perluasan menyang donya lan dadi bank pisanan saka AS kang duwé departemen ana ing jaban rangkah. Nalika taun &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt; citibank dadi bank gedhé dhéwé ana ing donya kang duwé cabang punjul 100 cabang kang manggon ana ing 23 nagara. Citibank banjur nganti jenenge dadi The First National City Bank of New York nalika taun &lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt;, lan dadi First National City Bank nalika taun &lt;a href="1962"&gt;1962&lt;/a&gt; lan banjur dadi Citibank nalika &lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt;. Citibank saiki kalebu dadi konsumen lan perusahaan bank saka &lt;a href="jasa%20finansial"&gt;jasa finansial&lt;/a&gt; raseksa &lt;a href="Citigroup"&gt;Citigroup&lt;/a&gt;, perusahaan kang gedhé dhéwé ana ing donya. Citibank ana ing punjul 50 nagara ing donya lan punjul sapérangan saka jumlan 1400 kantore mapan ana ing AS, lan akèh-akèhé mapan ana ing &lt;a href="New%20York%2C%20New%20York"&gt;New York, New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chicago%2C%20Illinois"&gt;Chicago, Illinois&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miami%2C%20Florida"&gt;Miami, Florida&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20DC"&gt;Washington, DC&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Bank"&gt;Bank&lt;/a&gt; iki uga nawakake produk &lt;a href="asuransi"&gt;asuransi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="investasi"&gt;investasi&lt;/a&gt;. Citibank nawakake pelayanan online lan dadi salah siji kang paling sukses kanthi duwé pelanggan kang cacahé 15 juta naraguna.
