<h2>Toyota Camry ing Indonesia</h2>
Toyota Camry ing Indonesia.
Nalika tanggal &lt;a href="9"&gt;9&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; kang kapungkur, Toyota Motor Sales, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; mbiwara Safety Campaign kanggo montor Toyota Camry kang dipasaraké ing tlatah &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Lor"&gt;Amérika Lor&lt;/a&gt;. Kaanan iki amarga ana masalah &lt;a href="rem"&gt;rem&lt;/a&gt; ing mobil Totota Camry. Nanging Toyota Motor Corporation (TMC) nerangaké yèn Toyota Camry kang dipasaraké karo &lt;a href="PT.%20Toyota%20Astra%20Motor"&gt;PT. Toyota Astra Motor&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; ora ana gayutané karo recall kang dianakaké karo Toyota Motor Sales, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;.
Mulané &lt;a href="Joko%20Trisanyoto"&gt;Joko Trisanyoto&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi &lt;a href="Direktur%20Marketing"&gt;Direktur Marketing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="PT.%20Toyota-Astra%20Motor"&gt;PT. Toyota-Astra Motor&lt;/a&gt; nalika iku nerangaké yèn konsumen kang nggunakaké Toyota Camry ora perlu kuwatir nggunakaké montor iki.
