Nickelodeon (dikenal uga kanthi jeneng Nick, sadurungé duwé jeneng Pinwheel; diadegaké ing tanggal &lt;a href="1%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;1 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku jaringan TV kabel mirunggan kanggo acara &lt;a href="bocah%20cilik"&gt;bocah cilik&lt;/a&gt; lan praremaja, nanging uga nayangké program kanggo remaja ing blok acara &lt;a href="TEENick"&gt;TEENick&lt;/a&gt;. Pisanan mung ana ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, nanging saiki wis ana ing nagara-nagara kaya ing wewengkon &lt;a href="Asia%20Tenggara"&gt;Asia Tenggara&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Selandia%20Baru"&gt;Selandia Baru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Skandinavia"&gt;Skandinavia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20Barat"&gt;Éropa Barat&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Latin"&gt;Amérika Latin&lt;/a&gt;. Ing Indonésia program Nickelodeon bisa dideleng ing &lt;a href="Global%20TV"&gt;Global TV&lt;/a&gt; lan TV kang bayar kaya ta &lt;a href="Indovision"&gt;Indovision&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="First%20Media"&gt;First Media&lt;/a&gt;.
