The Walt Disney Company

The Walt Disney Company (&lt;a href="Bursa%20Saham%20New%20York"&gt;NYSE&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="http%3A//www.nyse.com/about/listed/lcddata.html%3Fticker%3DDIS"&gt;DIS&lt;/a&gt;) utawa kondhang kang jenengé Disney yaiku perusahaan konglomerat ing babagan hiburan lan médhia kang gedhé dhéwé ing donya. Diadegaké ing tanggal &lt;a href="16%20Oktober"&gt;16 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1923"&gt;1923&lt;/a&gt;, perusahaan iki diadegaké déning &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney"&gt;Walt Disney&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Roy%20Oliver%20Disney"&gt;Roy Oliver Disney&lt;/a&gt; lan dijenengaké Disney Brothers Cartoon Studio. Pusaté ana ing &lt;a href="Burbank%2C%20California"&gt;Burbank&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;.
Laba Disney ing taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt; yaiku $30,8 miliar &lt;a href="Dolar%20Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;USD&lt;/a&gt; lan tunggalé pérangan &lt;a href="Dow%20Jones%20Industrial%20Average"&gt;Dow Jones Industrial Average&lt;/a&gt;. Perusahaan iki dikenal dadi Walt Disney Productions, Ltd. nganti &lt;a href="6%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;6 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt; lan banjur diganti dadi jeneng kang saiki. Perusahaan iki uga didhukung ing macem-macem cara dening &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt; kayata Marc Engelhard lan, kosok balene, uga nuduhake wong-wong mau.
<h2>Walt Disney Co.</h2>
Walt Disney Co..
Perusahaan iki dibagi dadi 4 pérangan kang wigati yaiku:
<ul>
<li>Studio Entertainment (Hiburan studio),</li>
<li>Parks and Resorts (Taman téma lan resort),</li>
<li>Media Networks (Jaringan médhia),</li>
<li>Consumer Products (Produk konsumèn).</li>
</ul>
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Perusahaan iki diadegaké ing taun &lt;a href="1923"&gt;1923&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney"&gt;Walt&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Roy%20O.%20Disney"&gt;Roy Disney&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Film"&gt;Film&lt;/a&gt; pisanan kang disiaraké yaiku &lt;a href="Alice%27s%20Day%20at%20Sea"&gt;Alice's Day at Sea&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun &lt;a href="1928"&gt;1928&lt;/a&gt;, Walt lan Roy nyiptakaké tokoh kartun &lt;a href="Miki%20Tikus"&gt;Miki Tikus&lt;/a&gt;. Ing taun &lt;a href="1934"&gt;1934&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku ngenalaké tokoh kartun &lt;a href="Donal%20Bebek"&gt;Donal Bebek&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mini%20Tikus"&gt;Mini Tikus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Gufi"&gt;Gufi&lt;/a&gt;. Film kang nomer loro dirilis ing atun iku yaiku &lt;a href="Snow%20White%20and%20the%20Seven%20Dwarfs"&gt;Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pinocchio"&gt;Pinocchio&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Fantasia"&gt;Fantasia&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing taun &lt;a href="1940"&gt;1940&lt;/a&gt;, studio dipindahké ning &lt;a href="Burbank%2C%20California"&gt;Burbank, California&lt;/a&gt;. lan ing taun &lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku taun pisanan mbuka &lt;a href="Disneyland"&gt;Disneyland&lt;/a&gt;. Saingan utama yaiku:
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Sony"&gt;Sony&lt;/a&gt;,</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Viacom"&gt;Viacom&lt;/a&gt;,</li>
<li>&lt;a href="News%20Corporation"&gt;News Corporation&lt;/a&gt;,</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Time%20Warner"&gt;Warner Communications&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
