Pixar Animation Studios ya iku sawijiné studio &lt;a href="animasi%20komputer"&gt;animasi komputer&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé pusat ing &lt;a href="Emeryville%2C%20California"&gt;Emeryville, California&lt;/a&gt; lan dikenal wis éntuk pitu &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt;. Pixar kondhang saka &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; animasi &lt;a href="Computer-generated%20imagery"&gt;CGI&lt;/a&gt;—kaya &lt;a href="Toy%20Story"&gt;Toy Story&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Finding%20Nemo"&gt;Finding Nemo&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Cars%20%28filem%29"&gt;Cars&lt;/a&gt;—kang dienggo ing panganggoan &lt;a href="PhotoRealistic%20RenderMan"&gt;PhotoRealistic RenderMan&lt;/a&gt;, ya iku pemrograman aplikasi API, saka &lt;a href="RenderMan%20Interface%20Specification"&gt;Renderman&lt;/a&gt; kang dienggo kanggo ngasilaké gambar kualitas dhuwur.
